OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the Milburn report mean
OL,4,Afor Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major review has proposed widespread
OL,7,Fchanges to tax, welfare and education
OL,8,Fto help get young people into work.
OL,10,FThe author, former Labour minister Alan
OL,11,FMilburn, says his diagnosis of the
OL,12,Fproblem applies UK-wide - yet the vast
OL,13,Fbulk of his report relates only to
OL,14,FEngland.
OL,16,FThe report doesn't mention Scotland at
OL,17,Fall until page 93, and even then only
OL,18,Fin passing.
