OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the Milburn report mean
OL,4,Afor Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is another 100 pages before he notes
OL,7,Fthat education, skills, health and
OL,8,Flocal government are devolved to
OL,9,FEdinburgh, Cardiff and Belfast.
